      "writtenOn": "2020-05-26T20:27:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I guess there is no easy/dirty fix to exclude this file from presubmits? Assuming the diffAllowedApexDepsInfoRule check will be in droid, we don\u0027t need presubmits to modify it.\n\nThe other option is to put this somewhere in frameworks/base/. Is that better in terms of extra presubmits?\n\nAs a follow up I can also work on making the whitelist sharded, and have allowed_deps.txt next to the Android.bp files that define individual modules. However, I want this to be submitted as V0 for now, and focus on lint in Q2. (and obviously prioritize this if people complain.)\n\nI\u0027ve added OWNERS file here.",
      "parentUuid": "b31ba6f3_4b32e256",
