      "writtenOn": "2020-05-20T20:50:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IIRC (and I may be wrong or out of date) the goal here was to list which modules had agreed to the extra mainline requirements and could be used as a dependency anywhere, and not to whitelist every individual dependency of every module?",
      "revId": "e4e1f2c64df58cd124461432a404543271b968ed",
